# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Xu Huang et al. (2025). Cross-functional transferability in foundation machine learning interatomic potentials.
#   npj Computational Materials. doi:10.1038/s41524-025-01796-y  arXiv:2504.05565v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2504.05565v1 (sha256 668217e4dad6b27b...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 88 (Training/reliability). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: the four CHGNet models trained or fine-tuned on the
# MP-r2SCAN data set to compare strategies for moving a GGA/GGA+U
# pretrained universal potential to r2SCAN (training from scratch;
# transfer learning with trainable, frozen, or refitted atomic reference
# energies), with the test errors of Table I.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
